            <div xml:id="m-b36c1a36-019b-4a7d-9507-db9b65abfab0">
              <lg xml:id="m-e574034a-8e17-4988-85d9-e6aebb732dfd">
                <l xml:id="m-b5ef96d5-04cf-4810-b201-5c3122d99ea5" facs="#m-7f808c92-b715-4f40-9313-d6d90929f4af" label="ambiguous">550</l><l xml:id="m-0e9f9d56-f8b4-4594-bd24-48aaf6d65b1b" facs="#m-75a2b287-0387-4968-ad16-4e30cab88069" label="text-like">2nd Sunday of Lent.</l><l xml:id="m-c967a747-b696-430d-97fe-fe2122d97dd7" facs="#m-468175e3-39f6-459f-a82f-8c1f0f506d4d" label="lyrics-like">Mó-y-si ú-num, et E-li-ae ú-num. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-632f6e3c-0492-46d9-a057-95c613164b2f" facs="#m-893c79ef-8783-445e-84ed-418cbb29e3d4" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-04c1578c-33f0-4850-99de-aaec731ac025" facs="#m-946e56b3-ca7a-4785-b4a2-e5604786b13a" label="ambiguous">1. Thess. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-f44124d7-4dab-4ce6-a556-58dda16f4cb3" facs="#m-eabc705a-aaa9-4127-89d4-85946559e583" label="lyrics-like">Aec est enim volúntas Dei,! unusquisque vestrum vas suum pos¬</l><l xml:id="m-820169f3-ad64-43c1-97ef-1c6a3f69105e" facs="#m-824a8ee0-fd41-44ba-a685-b5b2b49020f8" label="lyrics-like">It sanctificátio vestra: t ut absti- sidéré in sanctificatióne et honóre.</l><l xml:id="m-2898cd66-4eca-4aca-b0bf-e82d91083c00" facs="#m-e3ade2f7-bda4-4d4c-b173-a035953a9902" label="lyrics-like">neátis vos a fornicatióne, "ut sciat</l><l xml:id="m-134cc563-fc79-4429-8cbe-18e0591f7770" facs="#m-19384e9d-bff4-4c0e-b43a-e0508d7e107a" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Scápulis súis. V. Scúto. p. 244.</l><l xml:id="m-d16ab915-39d1-492b-bf82-2c4590c338ee" facs="#m-bd856aa6-0602-4757-ae89-d361baf39dea" label="text-like">AT NONE</l><l xml:id="m-a28ae6b0-5d4c-41eb-b2e0-2c60ad1cdb03" facs="#m-4fd68174-153b-480e-a2e9-5c0f097af4b4" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Visiónem. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-2af9e6e7-d79f-4472-b53a-01f723b02311" facs="#m-7dff4efb-abf3-4755-979b-80d347cb71dd" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-829b7f6a-6ddb-4cfb-a9e4-7b9b5186a7d6" facs="#m-60f5b6d6-6e4e-4d2d-9681-ba1c0add6f70" label="ambiguous">r. Thess. 4. b.</l><l xml:id="m-13f4aa37-33f0-4221-a15e-e2b1317ab9b0" facs="#m-7bcf8ad8-b072-47af-a21e-c097c39705c4" label="lyrics-like">ON enim vocávit nos Deus in ficatiónem,“ in Christo Jesu Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-13a2959a-821b-4fa6-b51b-bdfe5f3a4916" facs="#m-f255e5c2-4459-49ac-a7f8-6bc5473c5609" label="lyrics-like">1C immundítiam, t sed in sancti-l mino nostro.</l><l xml:id="m-074100a9-a561-4277-9bf1-57d5b35b13ff" facs="#m-50608912-d004-4e38-9d0e-737df4bb9c80" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Scúto. V. Angelis súis. p. 248.</l><l xml:id="m-a00406de-9e9d-4c5c-b68c-ae68b26b8f52" facs="#m-5ea8f65c-c43c-4f8a-abb3-d0b67f5ffb58" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-11ed7284-18e3-40ff-ab62-b1bc88c39c7b" facs="#m-8ad654ac-64bc-4d9d-9041-ec32fc95433c" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the Sunday, p. 251.</l><l xml:id="m-baffa823-277d-4b01-a8d0-8cae95aa519e" facs="#m-e7f0ea72-621c-4a1a-bece-cdec229adcfa" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-c34510ce-2825-48cb-9c71-1e3aaa26e020" facs="#m-10c28858-b109-46e5-babd-765315d12b50" label="ambiguous">r. Thess. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-bcbd105d-f461-4224-a7ab-70fe96a56c13" facs="#m-cd3620ca-9fbe-456a-b806-3f3a3629e26c" label="lyrics-like">Ratres: Rogámus vos, et obse-] quómodo vos opórteat ambuláre,</l><l xml:id="m-e00b840d-383d-42c2-9b53-761578167314" facs="#m-53eb0d95-b386-4af5-b041-8e29b5d3aa37" label="lyrics-like">1crámus in Dómino Jesu: t ut</l><l xml:id="m-336ad0bc-7437-4753-bd0b-0e8cdf97b0d2" facs="#m-aadb64a9-4ab3-4c3a-99c5-c7197f58e8a3" label="lyrics-like">et placére Deo:*sic et ambulétis,</l><l xml:id="m-a5e07b50-1fa7-43f3-869c-f60fe539ce2a" facs="#m-93ec0d65-28e0-43e4-8aba-c6ce2c2781ee" label="lyrics-like">quemádmodum accepistis a nobisl ut abundétis magis.</l><l xml:id="m-a915091e-675e-4756-b5b1-6a00d07a7d12" facs="#m-e54a72c3-a366-4f6c-bfa1-a38a7daf0f6d" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Audi benigne Cónditor. p. 539. Y. Angelis súis.</l><l xml:id="m-073313b2-8244-463d-a499-fd2b975c3665" facs="#m-2f15ee63-899c-4240-95a7-aefd29f90463" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-41e74a8e-5b9e-47be-b694-016904e764be" facs="#m-010ccc61-1eb8-4f11-8684-9c7f424c2cd8" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.1</l><l xml:id="m-561f3bf1-f54f-4f62-85f6-27abbad11127" facs="#m-09581d9c-766e-42c8-a811-560589e146a1" label="ambiguous">Y</l><l xml:id="m-7b0e4ca8-6979-4bcc-9aed-50ff195cb224" facs="#m-dc1745f3-d789-4ea8-84cb-d1ecad462232" label="lyrics-like">I-si-ónem“ quam vi-dístis,</l><l xml:id="m-876105d0-9053-40af-afcc-88b3a45158e5" facs="#m-79294aa5-4efe-4575-9ed9-9147f77ec5d0" label="lyrics-like">némi-ni dixé-ri¬</l><l xml:id="m-55f73cd4-ac75-4c5b-bd7e-66734a3f55ce" facs="#m-8db0b445-e42b-4012-8053-518971e64e8b" label="lyrics-like">tis, do-nec a mórtu-is resúrgat Fl-li-us hómi-nis.</l><l xml:id="m-0ffb5dc3-6fde-42e5-b6ac-ee6956f11760" facs="#m-83e63718-7027-46e7-a62a-fc698fa1b2f5" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
